# Vendored agent skills are byte-for-byte copies of their upstreams, pinned by
# a content hash in skills-lock.json. Reformatting them breaks that hash, so
# every `skills update -p` would see a phantom change and the weekly updater
# would open a PR that only adds or strips whitespace. This also keeps
# `pnpm format:check` (which globs **/*.md) from failing on upstream files.
